@MarkdownGenQAs_HostAddress = http://localhost:5184
@id = 5e404ebe-9c9f-440d-9e1a-bf613609e33b
@categoryId = d48d8b16-f4ee-4f63-bf47-7d628306d02c
@taskId = tuantran-2281988f-ac43-49a9-ba64-25e6a4a028e0

### 1. Upload PDF
POST {{MarkdownGenQAs_HostAddress}}/api/v1/files/upload
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="File"; filename="test_75.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< ./data/tests/test_75.pdf
--boundary--

### 2. Get all files
GET {{MarkdownGenQAs_HostAddress}}/api/v1/documents
Accept: application/json

### 3. Get file by ID
GET {{MarkdownGenQAs_HostAddress}}/api/v1/files/{{id}}
Accept: application/json

### 4. Update file metadata
PUT {{MarkdownGenQAs_HostAddress}}/api/v1/files/{{id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "author": "Updated Author",
  "categoryId": "{{categoryId}}"
}

### 5. Delete File (Cleanup DB and S3)
DELETE {{MarkdownGenQAs_HostAddress}}/api/v1/files/{{id}}


# ==============================================================================
# OCR OPERATIONS (API v1.2 Flow)
# ==============================================================================

### 6. Start OCR Process (default model: chandraocr)
# Uses our internal Document ID. This triggers the external OCR service.
POST {{MarkdownGenQAs_HostAddress}}/api/v1/files/ocr/process/{{id}}

### 7. Start OCR Process with custom modelId
POST {{MarkdownGenQAs_HostAddress}}/api/v1/files/ocr/process/{{id}}?modelId=deepseekocr

### 8. [NOT IMPLEMENTED] OCR Notification (SSE)
# Deprecated in v1.2, replaced by Redis Stream polling/events.
GET {{MarkdownGenQAs_HostAddress}}/api/v1/files/ocr/notification/{{id}}
Accept: text/event-stream

### 9. [NOT IMPLEMENTED] Get OCR Job Status (Polling)
GET {{MarkdownGenQAs_HostAddress}}/api/v1/files/ocr/status/{{id}}

### 10. [NOT IMPLEMENTED] Cancel OCR Job
POST {{MarkdownGenQAs_HostAddress}}/api/v1/files/ocr/cancel/{{id}}


# ==============================================================================
# GEN-QA OPERATIONS
# ==============================================================================

### 11. Start GenQA Process
POST {{MarkdownGenQAs_HostAddress}}/api/v1/files/gen-qa/process/{{id}}

### 12. [NOT IMPLEMENTED] GenQA Notification (SSE)
GET {{MarkdownGenQAs_HostAddress}}/api/v1/files/gen-qa/notification/{{id}}
Accept: text/event-stream

### 13. [NOT IMPLEMENTED] Cancel GenQA
POST {{MarkdownGenQAs_HostAddress}}/api/v1/files/gen-qa/cancel/{{id}}


# ==============================================================================
# DOWNLOAD OPERATIONS
# ==============================================================================

### 14. Download OCR Markdown
GET {{MarkdownGenQAs_HostAddress}}/api/v1/files/{{id}}/download?scope=markdown

### 15. Download PDF (Original)
GET {{MarkdownGenQAs_HostAddress}}/api/v1/files/{{id}}/download?scope=original

### 16. Download QAs (Markdown format)
GET {{MarkdownGenQAs_HostAddress}}/api/v1/files/{{id}}/download?scope=qa-markdown

### 17. Download QAs (JSON format)
GET {{MarkdownGenQAs_HostAddress}}/api/v1/files/{{id}}/download?scope=qa-json


# ==============================================================================
# JOBS & LOGS
# ==============================================================================

### 18. Get all OCR Jobs
GET {{MarkdownGenQAs_HostAddress}}/api/v1/ocr-jobs

### 19. Get OCR Job by File ID
GET {{MarkdownGenQAs_HostAddress}}/api/v1/ocr-jobs/by-file/{{id}}

### 20. Get OCR Job by External Task ID
GET {{MarkdownGenQAs_HostAddress}}/api/v1/ocr-jobs/by-external-file/{{taskId}}

### 21. Get Logs for File
GET {{MarkdownGenQAs_HostAddress}}/api/v1/logs/file/{{id}}


# ==============================================================================
# EXTERNAL OCR SERVER TESTING (Direct Connection)
# ==============================================================================

### 22. [DEBUG] Test OCR Server Directly
# Base URL: http://localhost:8888/api/v1
POST http://localhost:8888/api/v1/ocr/process
Content-Disposition: attachment; filename="test.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< ./datas/test.pdf

### 23. [DEBUG] Check Job Status on OCR Server
GET http://localhost:8888/api/v1/ocr/status/{{taskId}}

### 24. [DEBUG] Download Result from OCR Server
GET http://localhost:8888/api/v1/ocr/result/{{taskId}}


